[[File:Runecraft.png|left]]
[[Runecraft]] is mostly trained as [[Pay-to-play Runecraft training|normal]], especially if training Runecraft through non-essence methods. However, [[essence]]-based training methods can be troublesome for ironmen due to lack of buying essence from the [[Grand Exchange]] and instead, ironmen would have to either passively obtain large quantities of [[pure essence]]s in bulk from other activities or actively [[#Acquiring essence|gather essence]]. Fortunately, ironmen can effectively reach {{SCP|Runecraft|99|link=yes}} through non-essence training methods.

==Non-essence training methods==
These are fast and recommendable methods to train Runecraft that don't require a supply of [[rune essence]], [[pure essence]], or [[daeyalt essence]].

===Early training: Quests===
{{Main|Quest experience rewards#Runecraft}}

[[Rune Mysteries]] is required for unlocking the Runecraft skill, however it rewards no experience. [[Enter the Abyss]] is available immediately afterwards, and rewards 1,000 experience,  enough for level {{SCP|Runecraft|9}}. This miniquest does require briefly entering low-level [[Wilderness]], so [[File:Hardcore ironman chat badge.png]] [[hardcore ironmen]] should beware. At {{SCP|Runecraft|10|link=yes}}, the [[Temple of the Eye]] quest is available which grants a total of 9,210 experience during and after the quest, which is enough to reach the {{SCP|Runecraft|27|link=yes}} level requirement to do the [[Guardians of the Rift]] minigame.
* [[Enter the Abyss]] rewards {{SCP|Runecraft}} 1,000 Runecraft experience.
* [[Temple of the Eye]] requires {{SCP|Runecraft|10}}, gives {{SCP|Runecraft}} 4,210 Runecraft experience during the quest and rewards {{SCP|Runecraft}} 5,000 Runecraft experience after the quest ({{SCP|Runecraft}} 9,210 Runecraft experience total)
* [[The Ascent of Arceuus]] requires [[Client of Kourend]] and {{SCP|Hunter|12}}, rewards {{SCP|Runecraft}} 500 Runecraft experience
* [[The Eyes of Glouphrie]] requires [[The Grand Tree]], {{SCP|Construction|5}}, {{SCP|Magic|46}}, rewards {{SCP|Runecraft}} 6,000 Runecraft experience

