#Starting at the Arceuus essence mine, mine a full inventory of dense essence blocks, use them on the Dark Altar to create dark essence blocks.
#Run back to the essence mine and use a chisel on the dark essence blocks to create dark essence fragments while running back to the mine.
#Mine a second inventory of essence blocks, use them on the Dark Altar.
#Chisel 1 dark essence block and head to the runic altar.
#Craft runes at the altar, chisel the second inventory of dark essence blocks into fragments, craft runes once more and return to the essence mine.

Players who have completed the elite tasks of the [[Lumbridge & Draynor Diary]] (players without the tasks done may carry a [[Dramen staff]]), and have a [[revitalisation pool]] and [[Fairy ring (Construction)|fairy ring]] in their [[player-owned house]] can alternatively use Teleport to house to make the procedure slightly faster and remove the need for the graceful outfit, this would allow players to wear [[Raiments of the eye]] and craft an additional 60% more runes. A [[construction cape]] or [[rune pouch]] with law runes, dust runes, and an empty spot for the crafted runes will allow for no lost inventory slots. For blood runecrafting, after making a second inventory of dark essence blocks teleport to your house, restore run energy with the pool, use the fairy ring {{Fairycode|CIS}} and run to the altar. For soul runecrafting, after crafting runes at the altar teleport to your house, restore run energy with the pool, use the fairy ring {{Fairycode|CIS}} and return to the essence mine.

==Essence training methods==
===Acquiring essence===
[[Pure essence|Essence]] can be acquired through a variety of methods, with the simplest being the [[rune essence mine]]. However, certain other methods are likely to be superior, offering faster rates of acquisition, or lower effort in obtaining essence.
====Active methods====
'''Rune essence mine'''

After completion of [[Rune Mysteries]], the [[rune essence mine]] can be accessed. While the rates offered are worse than other methods, with a maximum of around 2,000 essence obtainable per hour with a [[rune pickaxe]] and [[essence pouch]]es, it can be the simplest and earliest method available.

'''Temple Trekking'''

After completion of [[In Aid of the Myreque]], the [[Temple Trekking]] minigame can be played. Completing treks with an easy companion on Route 1 provides 50 pure essence per trip, with possible rates of 3,000-4,000 per hour. Because all combat instances can be evaded on Route 1, low level players can avoid combat entirely and focus on completing treks as fast as possible. With [[Protection prayers]], players are able to avoid taking almost any damage. Higher level players can also consider using Route 3 with a medium or hard companion, potentially offering higher rates of 5,000–10,000 pure essence per hour. It is highly recommended to complete [[Darkness of Hallowvale]] for access to the reverse route of Temple Trekking, Burgh de Rott Ramble, as this enables consecutive treks without having to return to Burgh de Rott. The [[Lumberjack outfit]] can also be obtained while completing treks. See the [[Temple Trekking]] page for more info on what enemies/encounters to avoid, and how to get the Lumberjack outfit.

'''Soul Wars'''

One option for obtaining pure essence is opening [[Spoils of war]] from [[Soul Wars]]. On average, a player will receive 1,000 [[pure essence]] for every three Spoils of war opened. Each game lasts 15 minutes, and the 30 zeal needed to buy spoils of war depends on the amount of participation. Low level players (below 60 combat) may need 2 games to obtain over 30 zeal, while higher levels can easily obtain 30–40+ zeal per game. While this method is slower than others, it can be much lower effort for players that participate in coordinated Soul Wars games that involve a large amount of time spending idling.

'''Daeyalt essence mine'''

After completion of [[Sins of the Father]], [[daeyalt essence]] can be mined at the [[daeyalt essence mine]] beneath [[Darkmeyer]]. Daeyalt essence can be used in place of [[pure essence]], and grants 50% extra Runecraft experience when used. It can normally be mined at rates of up to 4,000 per hour, but usage of [[tick manipulation]] can enable higher rates of up to 9,000 essence per hour.

'''Scar essence mine'''

After partial completion of [[Desert Treasure II]], the [[Scar essence mine]] can be accessed. Rates of up to 10,000 [[pure essence|essence]] per hour are possible by mining [[tainted essence chunk]]s and converting them with the [[essence orifice]] into pure essence. Using [[Tick_manipulation#3-tick_Mining|Tick manipulation]], players can obtain over 18,000 essence per hour.

====Passive methods====
'''Slayer and Bossing'''

A high amount of pure essence is likely to be collected passively through [[Slayer]] and [[Boss|bossing]]. Many Slayer monsters, such as [[wyrm]]s, [[gargoyle]]s, [[Skeletal Wyvern]]s and [[Fossil Island wyvern]]s frequently drop pure essence in large quantities, as do certain boss encounters such as [[Zulrah]] and the [[Chambers of Xeric]]. Choosing to delay training Runecraft until after completing an amount of Slayer and bossing may entirely negate the need to ever actively gather essence.

'''Wizard Cromperty'''

With the [[medium Ardougne Diary]] completed, players can get 100 free noted pure essence a day from Wizard Cromperty. Completing the hard diary will give the player 150 free noted pure essence per day and completing the elite diary will give the player 250 free noted pure essence per day.

===Level 1+: Abyssal runecrafting===
The [[Abyss]] can be accessed after the completion of [[Enter the Abyss]], and will grant access to every altar without a talisman or tiara. It can be reached via the Wilderness.

The abyss typically offers worse experience rates than other methods due to the enemies and obstacles, however it can be valuable for access to remote altars to acquire specific runes the player needs (such as [[nature rune]]s, [[law rune]]s, etc.), or when a talisman is not available.

The abyss offers you the ability to choose which runes you want to craft and should be accessed using the Ferox Enclave Teleport which allows players to freely replenish run energy.

===Levels 23–99: Lava runes===
At level 23, players can craft [[Lava rune]]s. Without access to the [[Lunar spellbook]] and 82 [[Magic]] for [[Magic Imbue]] (requiring [[Lunar Diplomacy]]) this method can be difficult to use for Ironmen due to lack of access to elemental [[talisman]]s in bulk. Elemental talismans can be acquired from [[Guardians of the Rift]] but it's preferrable to do Ourania Altar runs instead.

''Without spellbook'': Fill an inventory with [[pure essence]], a [[fire tiara]], [[earth rune]]s, and an [[earth talisman]] and use a [[ring of dueling]] to teleport to the [[Emir's Arena]]. A few steps north is the [[Fire Altar]] where the runes can be crafted.  The ring of dueling can be used to teleport to [[Castle Wars]] for easy access to a bank, at which point the process can be repeated.

''With spellbook'': Equip a [[steam battlestaff]], fill your inventory with [[essence pouch]]es, a [[rune pouch]] filled with earth runes and [[astral runes]], and pure essence. The goal is to cast Magic Imbue so that earth talismans are not necessary. 

Players will need to make the emerald jewellery for crafting lava runes; however, high-level players may obtain significant quantities of [[binding necklace]]s while killing the [[Abyssal Sire]] for its unique drops.

===Levels 23–99: Ourania Altar (ZMI Altar)===
{{Main|Ourania Altar}}

Players can craft random runes at the Ourania Altar starting at {{SCP|Runecraft|1|link=yes}}, but getting there is slow and inefficient without completion of [[Lunar Diplomacy]] for [[Ourania Teleport]] (requiring {{SCP|Magic|71|link=yes}}). Completion of the medium [[Ardougne Diary]] is also highly recommended for bonus runes. Players may take a slow, winding path or faster path filled with low to mid level enemies. Players will not be hit often on official Ourania worlds, but low levels should be cautious. Once the above requirements are met:

# Set your spellbook to the [[Lunar spellbook]] by travelling to [[Lunar Isle]]. Remember to bring a [[Seal of passage]] if you wish to bank on Lunar Isle without completion of [[Dream Mentor]]. Quick transportation to Rellekka (and the boats to Lunar Isle) include [[Fremennik sea boots]] and [[Fairy rings]] nearby, DKS (north, [[Polar Hunter area]]) and AJR ([[Fremennik Slayer Dungeon]]).
# Wield an [[Earth battlestaff]] or [[Staff of earth]]. Fill your inventory with the following: [[law rune]]s, [[astral rune]]s, [[mind rune]]s (for payment to [[Eniola]]), [[essence pouch]]es (small, medium, large, and/or giant), and [[pure essence]].
# [[Ourania Teleport]] to the altar. ''The official Worlds for '''Ourania Altar''' are 327, 480 ([[P2P]]).''
# Run toward the altar and take the ladder down, following the combat path to the altar, and craft your runes. 
# Teleport back to the altar with [[Ourania Teleport]]. Rinse and repeat, paying 20 [[mind rune]]s to access the bank at the entrance.
# Once run energy is depleted, replenish at [[Ferox Enclave]], then head back to the altar.
# When essence pouches decay, use [[NPC Contact]] to the [[Dark Mage (Abyss)|Dark Mage]] to repair them immediately and risk-free.

Optionally, alternate accounts can be used to take the aggression of the enemies in the caves, allowing for skilling on the run to the altar; popular options are fletching arrows and blowing molten glass. This will slightly lower Runecraft experience rates, especially with the latter, but as a whole it is more efficient than training them separately.

===Levels 95–99: Wrath runes===
At {{SCP|Runecraft|95|link=yes}} and after completing [[Dragon Slayer II]], players can craft [[wrath rune]]s. They are mainly used for casting [[offering spells]] to train [[Prayer]]. Wrath runes are dropped by high-level monsters in relatively small quantities, so generally the best way to get them is to craft them.

To access the [[Wrath Altar]], players will need to wear the [[Runecraft cape]], get a [[wrath talisman]] dropped by [[Vorkath]], [[adamant dragon]]s, or [[rune dragon]]s, use a [[catalytic talisman]] or [[catalytic tiara|tiara]] obtained from [[Guardians of the Rift]], or attune a [[hat of the eye]] with a wrath tiara or catalytic tiara. Players will also need a lot of noted pure essence, which can be obtained through training Slayer. For the fastest rates, players will also need to get all the essence pouches for carrying more pure essence per lap. Using a [[Desert amulet 4|desert amulet]] or having the [[ornate rejuvenation pool]] in the [[player-owned house]] is also recommended for restoring Hitpoints and run energy.

[[File:Hardcore ironman chat badge.png]] This method is potentially '''dangerous''', as players will need to run past high-level dragons. Using a higher render distance to click on the cave exit as soon as possible will decrease your chances of dying to the dragons should you disconnect on the run there.

Experience rates can vary depending on the inventory setup and the available teleport to unnote essence. Players can gain up to around {{SCP|Runecraft}}47,000 experience per hour when wearing the [[Runecraft cape]] and using the [[Crafting cape]] teleport to the [[Crafting Guild]] bank chest.

